---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 42
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as Administrator / analyst
    participant UI as Alert workspace
    participant API as Alerts API
    participant DB as Persistence
    participant XAI as Explanation service

    Analyst->>UI: Filter alerts
    UI->>API: GET /alerts/page
    API->>DB: Query matching alert evidence
    DB-->>API: Alert page and total
    API-->>UI: AlertPage

    Analyst->>UI: Open an alert
    UI->>API: GET /alerts/{id}
    API->>DB: Load alert evidence and feedback history
    DB-->>API: AlertDetail evidence
    API-->>UI: AlertDetail

    opt request ML explanation
        UI->>API: GET /alerts/{id}/explanation
        alt eligible ML alert and active artifacts
            API->>XAI: Compute local attributions
            XAI-->>API: Non-causal SHAP evidence
            API-->>UI: ExplanationResponse
        else not applicable or unavailable
            API-->>UI: 409 or 503 response
        end
    end

    opt record disposition
        Analyst->>UI: Select status and notes
        UI->>API: POST /alerts/{id}/feedback
        API->>DB: Commit feedback and current status
        DB-->>API: Saved feedback
        API-->>UI: 201 FeedbackResponse
    end
